      "body": "Validation: the targeted rerun of `test_disaggregation_decode_radix_cache_swa.py` on this branch landed on `h200-gmi-wk03`, the same runner where run 39977798414 failed, and passed (run 39989893915, 2 tests, gsm8k 0.898 / 0.876).\n\nThe new log line shows the init times on that host under a real CI job:\n\n```\nNIXL create_backend('UCX', {}) returned in 9.1s                     # decode, 0 threads\nNIXL create_backend('UCX', {'num_threads': '8'}) returned in 46.2s  # prefill, 8 threads\n```\n\nWith the previous 60 s default the prefill side had under 14 s of headroom on this host, which is what the earlier failure consumed.\n",
